  "title": "Under Armour Appoints Kevin Ross as Senior Vice President, Managing Director of EMEA",
  "summary": "Under Armour today announced the appointment of Kevin Ross as its new Senior Vice President, Managing Director of Europe, Middle East & Africa. With nearly 20 years of experience growing high profile brands including adidas, TaylorMade, Under Armour, and Yeti, Ross brings proven talent and regional expertise to the company.",
